			"Message": "chore(Element): Advance all submodules to latest upstream revisions\n\nBatch update across all 13 Element submodules (Cocoon, Common, Echo, Grove, Maintain, Mist, Mountain, Output, Rest, SideCar, Sky, Vine, Wind) synchronizing with upstream revisions.\n\nKey changes:\n- Maintain applies consistent formatting and lint allowances across the crate, consolidating README.md emoji into component title text and removing separate emoji table cells for cleaner rendering\n- Mountain standardizes whitespace and formatting across Air client integration, application state DTOs, environment providers, IPC command handlers, extension management, and Cocoon gRPC service handlers (150+ files), and adds WorkingCopyDispatcher and WorkspaceDispatcher for WindServiceHandlers command routing\n- All other submodules advance with routine merge updates and mechanical formatting normalizations\n\nAll changes maintain API compatibility; no functional modifications or breaking changes.",
			"SHA": "d411c769bb73d2f2964829cb1584a3ab77026e88"
		}
